                            "v": "OCR and English translation pipeline for James Ussher's \"Britannicarum Ecclesiarum Antiquitates\" (1639). Extracts structured Latin text from photocopied book PDFs using Tesseract with LSTM fine-tuning for historical print, then produces bilingual Latin-English reading documents. Includes annotation tooling and QA workflows."
